  "description": "The Solace Gravel 30 E-Bike makes saddling up for your best gravel rides easier than ever. With boosted power in an already lightweight, agile, and versatile frame design, you’ll have the confidence and stamina to explore further.\n\nThe new TQ HPR60 motor unit is updated from its predecessor, which delivers 60Nm of torque for a 20% boost in performance your legs will appreciate when mashing up the steepest grades.\nControlling all the torque into forward propulsion are 50mm Schwalbe G-One Overland tires that provide critical traction on high-slip slopes and cushion to roll over rough terrain when you’re going flat out with Solace’s new powerband.\n\nThis Solace gets SRAM’s Apex XPLR AX 12-speed groupset that delivers performance-focused shifting and the gearing range premium drivetrains without the steep buy-in. It’s the perfect setup if you’re looking to get into gravel on your first E-Bike.\n\nPlease note that bike specifications are subject to change without prior notice.",
